Third-party data and models
---------------------------
Kellular does not redistribute third-party datasets or model weights. Each
external source used by the project (e.g. TCGA/GDC, CPTAC, DepMap, GDSC,
cBioPortal studies, Tahoe-100M, CELLxGENE, ChEMBL, Open Targets, Reactome)
remains the property of its owners and is used under its own license and
terms of access. The authoritative list of sources, their licenses, required
citations and access tier lives in docs/DATA_SOURCES.md and must be updated
before any new source is ingested.
